- හ්ම්!

513
00:26:48,410 --> 00:26:49,870
International Business Management!

514
00:26:49,950 --> 00:26:52,790
ඒයි, මම apply කළේ එක course එකකට විතරනෙ!

515
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:54,250
